        "type": "speech",
        "title": "讲解：左侧核心概念区",
        "text": "把关系看成从 A x B 中挑出来的一批 ordered pairs。"
      },
      {
        "id": "nb-mat102-zh-relations-equivalence-orders-20260519-spotlight-s02-03",
        "type": "spotlight",
        "elementId": "nb-mat102-zh-relations-equivalence-orders-20260519-s02-worked-board",
